            <ArticleTitle>Syntheses of procyanidin B2 and B3 gallate derivatives using equimolar condensation mediated by Yb(OTf)3 and their antitumor activities.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>4935-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bmcl.2013.06.061</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0960-894X(13)00794-4</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Synthesis of procyanidin B2 and B3 gallate derivatives, 3-O-gallate, 3&quot;-O-gallate, and 3,3&quot;-di-O-gallate, were synthesized using equimolar condensation mediated by Yb(OTf)3. Synthesized compounds showed significant antitumor effects against human prostate PC-3 cell lines. Their activities were weaker than well-known EGCG and prodelphinidin B3.</AbstractText>
